@display("std/lint")
lint: component(path = "std/lint", lang = "heron") {
  | The configuration of `heron lint` and the spec-aware prose lints, which importing the package turns on.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/lint/package.heron`, whose types the API
  | reference renders; each export is specified where its behaviour is:
  |
  | | Export                         | Specified in                        |
  | | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |
  | | `Lint`, `lint`, `Vale`, `Rule` | [the prose linter](#product.system.prose_linter) |

  uses = [language.std.types]
}
